---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout title={`关于 ${site.name}`}>
  <section class="site-shell mx-auto grid gap-8 pt-14 md:grid-cols-[1fr_280px] md:pt-20">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">关于</div>
      <h1 class="display mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl leading-tight md:text-7xl"><span data-profile="name">{site.name}</span>的项目、笔记与日常观察。</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="self-end text-base leading-8">
      <p class="m-0"><span data-profile="location">{site.location}</span><br /><span data-profile="headline">{site.headline}</span></p>
      <a class="focus-ring mt-5 inline-block underline" href={site.github} data-profile-href="github" aria-label="GitHub · TNHTH-blog 本站源码">GitHub → 本站源码</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell home-section mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
      <div class="eyebrow">关于我</div>
      <div class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-9">
        <p>我目前在杭州电子科技大学学习自动化。这里记录我做过的项目、学过的东西，以及过程中值得留下的实验与思考。</p>
        <p>我喜欢从一个具体的问题出发，把概念弄明白，把东西真正做出来，再把过程中值得留下的内容记录下来。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell home-section mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
      <div class="eyebrow">经历</div><div class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-9"><p>从机器人系统集成、嵌入式控制到强化学习实验，持续关注不同模块之间的接口、证据和真实边界。</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell home-section mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
      <div class="eyebrow">技术与实践</div><div class="flex max-w-3xl flex-wrap gap-2">{site.practice?.map((item) => <span class="tag">{item}</span>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell home-section mx-auto">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
      <div class="eyebrow">其他兴趣</div><div class="max-w-3xl text-lg leading-9"><p>阅读、摄影、写作与对日常系统的观察，会以笔记的形式自然出现在同一个内容池中。</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell home-section mx-auto pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr]">
      <div class="eyebrow">链接</div><div><a class="focus-ring underline" href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub · TNHTH-blog 本站源码">GitHub → 本站源码</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
